# Personal wiki (this folder)

This repo is standalone and personal:

- Treat all content as **life / non-work**. Work-adjacent items (resume, work history, career notes, some co-worker notes) are allowed; day-to-day work records belong in the separate work wiki.
- Add or edit files only inside this repo.
- Create subfolders (`people/`, `projects/`, `meetings/`, `reference/`, etc.) when useful.
- Do not require paths outside this repo for personal notes to make sense.
- `Personal Inbox/` is the personal drop zone: file its contents and move the sources out in the same turn (ask before deleting).
- Watch history: `media/watch-history.json` (schema in `media/README.md`).
- To-dos live in `todos/open.md` and `todos/archive.md`. New ids: `Pers-###`.
- Full rules: `ai-guidance/repository-rules.md`.
